[[File:Passaportoitaliano2006.jpg|thumb|200px|An [[Italian passport]]]]

'''Visa requirements for [[Italian nationality law|Italian citizens]]''' are administrative entry restrictions by the authorities of other states placed on citizens of [[Italy]].

As of 2026, Italian citizens had visa-free access to 185 countries and territories, ranking the [[Italian passport]] fourth in the world according to the [[Henley Passport Index]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.henleyglobal.com/passport-index/ranking |title=Global Passport Ranking}}</ref>

